    "title": "'Career suicide': Tom Hardy refused to film MobLand, kept Pierce Brosnan, Helen Mirren 'waiting for hours', says report | Web Series",
    "text": "Reports of Tom Hardy’s erratic behaviour on MobLand sets\nThe Hollywood Reporter cited a source as saying, “He refused to come out of his trailer for hours at a time. He kept the cast waiting, [which is] a power play. Keeping Pierce Brosnan, Helen Mirren and others waiting is career suicide, I would wager.” The allegedly problematic on-set behaviour pertained to the filming of the show’s second season. A third season has not been greenlit.",
